                "position": {
                    "x": -0.31889062703280047,
                    "y": 1135.5039052651082
                },
                "description": "Calculate total violation hours from extracted text.\n\nThis simplified version:\n- Extracts numeric values from text\n- Sums them up for most grievance types\n- For \"Excessive Hours\" types, subtracts 9.5 from each value >= 9.5",
